Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.58,0:00:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,Bună, ați sunat la Linia \NTelefonică Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.92,0:00:27.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să vedem. Numărul \Ntău de membru este...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, ești elev la gimnaziu?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.59,0:00:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,TLC,{\an8}Bună, ați sunat la Linia \NTelefonică Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.59,0:00:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum ești în această \Nseară minunată?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.09,0:00:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.74,0:01:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alo, Natsumi la telefon. \NAh, Emi. Cum merge cu clubul?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.45,0:01:45.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa și așa. \NNu sunt probleme.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.79,0:01:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce ai zice dacă ai mai trece pe aici \Ndin când în când? Doar tu {\i1}ești{\i0} șefa.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.92,0:01:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, eu sunt doar proprietara Cooperativei Natsumi,\N în ceea ce privește clubul.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apropo, Rumi,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.22,0:02:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,avem un client care are nevoie de tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.35,0:02:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți să notezi numărul?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.73,0:02:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dă-i drumul.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.39,0:02:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Domnul Sugiura din Mitaka. Problema lui este...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.15,0:02:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O problemă cu masturbarea?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.81,0:02:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Yumi, ce-i asta?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.77,0:02:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Noi nu ne ocupăm de așa ceva.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.98,0:02:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine, spune că i se schimbă corpul când se masturbează.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aici Sugiura.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt Suuko de la Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, s-salut.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți mulțumesc că ai sunat mai devreme.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, păi...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.64,0:03:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vocea ta pare lipsită de viață.\N E ceva grav, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.73,0:03:32.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, păi...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.02,0:03:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când mă masturbez,\N văd lumini și păsări și alte chestii,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.81,0:03:37.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,iar camera mea este făcută praf.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.02,0:03:40.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hai, calmează-te.\N Calmează-te și vorbește cu mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.65,0:03:45.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}P-Păi, aș vrea să ne întâlnim\N undeva. Ăă...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine ai venit!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mulțumesc că ai așteptat!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.41,0:04:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,O scrumieră pe o carte.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acela era semnul.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Sugiura.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt Suuko. Îmi pare bine să te cunosc!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.91,0:04:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine ați venit! Ce doriți?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un Earl Grey cu gheață, vă rog.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Desigur.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Probabil ai mare succes la fete!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.09,0:04:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,În legătură cu ce vorbeam mai devreme...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu este chiar o problemă atât de gravă.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am un prieten de vârsta ta care îl cunoaște foarte bine pe Freud.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.85,0:04:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Potrivit lui, libidoul este...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce na{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.23,0:04:59.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce s-a întâmplat cu hainele tale?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.11,0:05:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ori de câte ori încerc... ăă, se întâmplă asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.78,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Poftiți. Poftă bună.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Presupun că acesta nu este locul potrivit pentru Freud.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.91,0:05:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oricum, nu mai e distractiv dacă e prea ușor.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și trebuie să cheltuiesc o grămadă de bani pe haine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.41,0:05:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu te masturbezi aici?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.79,0:05:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.34,0:05:25.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poate apărea o șopârlă.\N Sau chiar un vârcolac.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.89,0:05:39.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este în regulă.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.23,0:05:42.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Întoarce-te încoace.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}S-Stai, a-aia e...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hei, chemați pe cineva o ambulanță.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Nu este rănit?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.68,0:06:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, ești bine?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Eu...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hai odată!{false i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.65,0:07:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Acum înțeleg la ce te refereai\N cu hainele.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ai făcut asta?{false i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce naiba ești?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.92,0:07:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taci!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.63,0:07:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.47,0:07:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce eu?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce vrei să fac?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.51,0:07:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu am putut să spun nimănui.\N Voiam doar să vorbesc despre asta.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.27,0:07:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa că...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așază-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.50,0:08:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îți spun să te așezi!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.92,0:08:16.05,Thought,,0,0,0,,Practic, când se gândește la lucruri obscene sau le vede...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.01,0:08:19.31,Thought,,0,0,0,,Ah, înțeleg.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se simte extraordinar.\N De ce nu iei și tu una?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.66,0:08:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nu e o idee bună \Nsă vin într-un loc ca acesta.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.87,0:08:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cu corpul meu în starea asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.12,0:08:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prostuțule. Crezi că o să mă culc cu un monstru?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa este, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:49.88,0:08:51.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.42,0:08:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt foarte... interesată de tine.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.40,0:09:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Se pare că am ajuns la ultima soluție.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.11,0:09:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Va trebui doar să te obișnuiești.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,„S-Să mă obișnuiesc”?!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, să te obișnuiești!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hai, hai, vino!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.75,0:10:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce mai faci?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.63,0:10:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și apoi tentaculele astea au făcut {\i1}bum{\i0}!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.47,0:10:24.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E adevărat! Nici măcar nu era un costum!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.77,0:10:25.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu e interesant?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.97,0:10:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un extraterestru, un proiect secret al vreunei țări, o persoană creată artificial!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.98,0:10:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu, o ființă încă nedescoperită...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.56,0:10:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar este un tip destul de arătos,\N nu crezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ca să ajungi să te îndrăgostești de el.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, ascultă ce spun!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.70,0:10:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face idei ciudate, surioară.\N E un monstru!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.28,0:10:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu. Este un monstru.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.66,0:10:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu ești și mai mult\N un monstru, totuși.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.75,Thought,,0,0,0,,Dar... fata asta...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.13,0:10:56.46,Thought,,0,0,0,,Unde am mai văzut-o?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.47,Thought,,0,0,0,,Eleva din primul an, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.93,Thought,,0,0,0,,Natsumi Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.14,0:11:12.69,Thought,,0,0,0,,Am găsit ceva interesant pentru prima dată după mult timp.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.98,0:11:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fac aceste fotografii.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.62,0:11:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, mamă, mă duc la Yumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu-ți face griji.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.79,0:11:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine. Pa, mamă.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Chiar te descurci bine, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.08,0:12:18.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Deci eleva-model, Natsumi Rumi,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,se transformă într-o femeie\N a nopții, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce vrei de la mine?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.38,0:12:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.64,0:12:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vreau doar să-l cunosc\N ceva mai bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.73,0:12:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este simplu.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.73,0:12:36.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Adu-l mâine la ora 4 la barul Shaggai,\N de lângă gară.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.23,0:12:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}Petrece noaptea gândindu-te la ce se va întâmpla dacă refuzi.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.39,0:13:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce este asta?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un mulțumesc pentru tot ce ai făcut până acum.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.97,0:13:12.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Un mulțumesc?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.69,0:13:19.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este ceva în neregulă?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:19.94,0:13:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nimic.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.21,0:13:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alo, eu sunt.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.67,0:13:43.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Poți să aduni gașca?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, cât mai repede posibil.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este ceva...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voiam să te întreb de ceva vreme, dar...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.81,0:13:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce anume?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Prima dată când ne-am întâlnit la cafenea...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Atunci...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,De ce nu ai fugit?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.99,0:14:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Asta pentru că eram interesată de tine atunci, Ryou.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:13.83,0:14:14.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Treabă excelentă!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.49,0:15:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Milady, aveți un apel telefonic.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.38,0:15:44.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Maki, e grav!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.67,0:15:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sora ta și ceilalți sunt cu monstrul.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu știu ce s-ar putea\N întâmpla. Sunt la...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.39,0:16:03.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Clădirea aceasta este\N abandonată de doi ani.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.52,0:16:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa că o folosim din când în când.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este bună pentru lucruri de genul acesta.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou! Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.80,0:16:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Noaptea este lungă.\N Să ne distrăm.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Încet și pe îndelete!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.93,0:16:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.56,0:16:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din ce spun prietenii mei,\N te transformi într-un adevărat monstru.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ei bine...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.57,0:16:52.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să vedem monstrul!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.45,0:17:03.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Știu să mă apăr!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.83,0:17:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vino și ia-o!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.67,0:17:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Milady, nu puteți folosi\N așa ceva!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așteptați! Milady!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.32,0:17:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acum, cine urmează?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ești puternică.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Îmi plac fetele puternice.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.16,0:18:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.82,0:19:01.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e tare!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.80,0:19:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hai să terminăm, nenorocitule!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.16,0:19:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Își va reveni curând.\N Își va reveni... Își va reveni curând.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.81,0:21:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fă ceva!\N E-Este iubitul tău, nu?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hei, Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perversule! Lașule!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.24,0:21:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tu... Tu...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.95,0:21:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sugiura Ryou...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.50,0:21:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Idiotule!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.47,0:22:55.97,Thought,,0,0,0,,Îmi amintesc!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.97,0:23:01.02,Thought,,0,0,0,,Mi-am pierdut memoria după\N ce am absorbit această formă de viață.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:02.52,0:23:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce? Ce se întâmplă?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:04.94,0:23:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:06.03,0:23:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E-Eu sunt...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.03,0:23:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eu sunt un colecționar!{not a Collectr}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:17.16,0:23:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toate formele de viață, din toate lumile...{false trailing i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:19.58,0:23:19.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oprește-te!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.05,0:23:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:28.21,0:23:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:40.64,0:23:43.77,Thought,,0,0,0,,De ce? De ce o parte din colecția mea...{false trailing i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.77,0:23:45.19,Thought,,0,0,0,,De ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.19,0:23:47.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taci! Taci!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:47.57,0:23:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Te rog...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:48.78,0:23:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleacă.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:52.66,0:23:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pleacă!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:37.91,0:24:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt Sugiura din Mitaka.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.62,0:24:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ăă...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:41.83,0:24:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Când mă masturbez,\N văd lumini și aud păsări,
Dialogue: 99,0:24:44.67,0:24:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,iar când mă trezesc,\N camera mea este complet devastată.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:41.72,0:25:44.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salut, aici este Madonna de Comunicare\N prin Telefon.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:44.85,0:25:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Salut, aici este Madonna de\NComunicare prin Telefon.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:47.48,0:25:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sunt Yumi, cu cine vorbesc?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:50.98,0:25:51.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, chiar?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:54.65,0:25:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bună, aici este Telecom Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.11,0:25:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Este suficient de bine?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:59.70,0:26:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa, ce dorești?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:01.70,0:26:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Ce porți acum?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:05.04,0:26:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce culoare are lenjeria ta?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:20.34,0:26:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am auzit că sora mea lucrează aici, așa că...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:24.22,0:26:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, este doar a doua ei zi, dar am auzit că se descurcă foarte bine.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:27.52,0:26:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Toată lumea este foarte impresionată.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:44.29,0:26:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mi-e frică!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:01.05,0:27:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gata!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:01.84,0:27:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am reușit!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:24.95,0:27:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Per{\alpha&HFF&\t(950,950,\alpha&H00&)}ver{\alpha&HFF&\t(1790,1790,\alpha&H00&)}sule.
