Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.50,0:00:46.23,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,I poured blue moonlight in a glass\N and put it to my lips
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.23,0:00:54.78,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,It'll ease the pain in your heart
Dialogue: 5,0:00:54.78,0:00:58.68,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,Everyone longs for a stimulus
Dialogue: 5,0:00:58.68,0:01:02.58,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,Let's invite passion to the sky
Dialogue: 5,0:01:02.58,0:01:06.44,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,Sweet music, that's it
Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.44,0:01:10.63,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,Two people in motion in the sky
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.63,0:01:16.38,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,Please call me tonight, don't forget
Dialogue: 5,0:01:18.34,0:01:24.98,OP1-E,,0,0,0,,Please call me tonight, once again
Dialogue: 5,0:27:46.35,0:27:53.94,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,I poured blue moonlight in the glass\N and put it to my lips
Dialogue: 5,0:27:53.94,0:28:02.65,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,I'll cheer up the pain in your aching heart
Dialogue: 5,0:28:02.65,0:28:06.57,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,No one is waiting for a stimulus
Dialogue: 5,0:28:06.57,0:28:10.43,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Let's invite passion to the sky
Dialogue: 5,0:28:10.43,0:28:14.32,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Sweet music, that's it
Dialogue: 5,0:28:14.32,0:28:18.48,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Two people in motion in the sky
Dialogue: 5,0:28:18.48,0:28:24.81,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Please call me tonight, don't forget
Dialogue: 5,0:28:26.26,0:28:32.83,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Please call me tonight, once again
Dialogue: 5,0:28:35.76,0:28:39.62,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,I'm gazing at the changing signal
Dialogue: 5,0:28:39.62,0:28:43.24,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Shifting tension in the wave
Dialogue: 5,0:28:43.60,0:28:47.41,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,The night seems devious and anxious
Dialogue: 5,0:28:47.41,0:28:51.57,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Tearful motion in the wave
Dialogue: 5,0:28:51.57,0:28:57.90,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Please call me tonight, please
Dialogue: 5,0:28:59.37,0:29:05.89,ED1-E,,0,0,0,,Please call me tonight, once again
Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.70,0:09:28.54,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,I won't turn off the candle light tonight{今夜は 消さない Candle Light}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.46,0:09:35.22,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,Dancing Queen, pretending to be Madonna{マドンナ 気取つて Dancing Queen}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:37.43,0:09:43.97,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,I'll decide what kind of rouge to wear{仕上げのルージュは 気分で決めるわ}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:43.97,0:09:49.61,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,I'm in love, I like my freedom{恋する 自由が好きよ}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:50.36,0:09:55.53,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,Why is this Friday night so wonderful?{なんで すてきな Friday Night}
Dialogue: 5,0:09:55.53,0:10:02.70,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,There's a moment of tenderness\N when I look at you{優しさの時間(とき) 見つめたいから}
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.70,0:10:06.87,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,I want to hold you right now{今すぐに 抱きしめて}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.07,0:14:07.45,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,Don't you say good-bye
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.45,0:14:14.12,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,I want you to be there for me{そばにいて欲しいの}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:14.12,0:14:17.33,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,Single rainy day
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.33,0:14:20.38,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,Shy baby face
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.38,0:14:25.80,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,I'm remembering tonight...{想い出してる tonight...}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:30.64,0:14:43.52,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,Once again, the two of us back then{あの頃の二人から once again}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.52,0:14:49.82,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,At night, I want to embrace you{r shoulders}{肩を抱かれ 夜に抱かれ}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:49.82,0:14:56.58,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,I want our heartbeats to overlap{鼓動(トキメキ) 重ねたいの}
Dialogue: 5,0:14:56.58,0:15:02.42,Ins-E,,0,0,0,,Let me hear today's hit song, that love song{あの日の hit song 聞かせて love song}
