Dialogue: 99,0:00:20.58,0:00:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Telephone\N Communication Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.92,0:00:27.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Your membership number is...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:27.88,0:00:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're a junior high school student?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.59,0:00:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hi, this is Telephone\N Communication Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:30.59,0:00:34.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How are you doing today?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:34.09,0:00:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.74,0:01:43.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, it's Natsumi. Oh, Emi. \NSo how's the club going? Well?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.45,0:01:45.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, not much trouble.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.79,0:01:50.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show your face here\N from time to time? You {\i1}are{\i0} the boss.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:50.92,0:01:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm only Natsumi Co-op's owner,\N as far as the club goes.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:56.22,0:01:57.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:58.22,0:01:59.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, Rumi,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:59.22,0:02:01.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's a client who needs you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.35,0:02:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you write down the number?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:05.73,0:02:06.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:06.39,0:02:09.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sugiura-san from Mitaka. His issue is...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.15,0:02:10.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A masturbation problem?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:10.81,0:02:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yumi, what's with this?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:12.77,0:02:14.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't handle this.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.98,0:02:19.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, he says his body changes when he masturbates.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sugiura here.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Suuko from Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:20.13,0:03:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, h-hi.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling earlier.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:23.64,0:03:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.64,0:03:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your voice seems dead.\N This is serious, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:30.73,0:03:32.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:32.02,0:03:34.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I masturbate,\N I see light and birds and stuff,
Dialogue: 99,0:03:34.81,0:03:37.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and my room gets trashed.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:37.02,0:03:40.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, just calm down.\N Calm down and talk to me!
Dialogue: 99,0:03:40.65,0:03:45.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}W-Well, I'd like to meet\N somewhere. Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:25.41,0:04:27.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ashtray on a book.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was the sign.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Sugiura.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:30.87,0:04:32.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Suuko. Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.91,0:04:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Welcome! What would you like?
Dialogue: 99,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iced Earl Grey, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:36.88,0:04:38.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:39.84,0:04:42.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be popular with girls!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:42.09,0:04:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Regarding what we were talking about before...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not such a serious problem.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:46.93,0:04:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have a friend who's about your age and very familiar with Freud.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:50.85,0:04:54.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to him, the libido is...
Dialogue: 99,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wha{\fscx250}-
Dialogue: 99,0:04:57.23,0:04:59.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened to your clothes?!
Dialogue: 99,0:04:59.11,0:05:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever I try... um, this happens.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:02.61,0:05:04.78,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Here you are. Please enjoy.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess this is no place for Freud.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:08.91,0:05:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's not fun if it's too easy, anyway.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:12.04,0:05:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to spend so much on clothes, too.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:14.41,0:05:17.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you masturbate here?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:17.79,0:05:18.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:19.34,0:05:25.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A lizard might appear.\N Maybe even a werewolf.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:30.93,0:05:32.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:36.89,0:05:39.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:40.23,0:05:42.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Face this way.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:08.27,0:06:10.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}W-Wait, th-that's...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hey, someone call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:12.44,0:06:13.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's not hurt?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:13.68,0:06:16.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, are you all right?!
Dialogue: 99,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 99,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,C-Come on!{false i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:07:10.65,0:07:11.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I can see what you mean\N about the clothes.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:25.67,0:07:27.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was that you?{false i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:07:27.46,0:07:28.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.92,0:07:29.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:31.63,0:07:32.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:33.47,0:07:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why me?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:35.47,0:07:37.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:37.51,0:07:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to tell anyone.\N I just wanted to talk about it.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:41.27,0:07:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sit down!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:00.50,0:08:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm tellin' ya to sit down!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.92,0:08:16.05,Thought,,0,0,0,,So basically, when he thinks or sees lewd things...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:17.01,0:08:19.31,Thought,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:37.37,0:08:39.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It feels great.\N Why don't you take one too?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:39.66,0:08:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-It's a bad idea, \Ncoming to a place like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.87,0:08:43.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With my body this way...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:43.12,0:08:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dummy. You think I'm going to sleep with a monster?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:47.29,0:08:48.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:49.88,0:08:51.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.42,0:08:56.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm very... interested in you.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:12.40,0:09:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're at the last resort.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:16.11,0:09:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll just have to get used to it.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:18.78,0:09:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"G-Get used to it"?!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:20.62,0:09:23.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, get used to it!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:34.21,0:09:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, come on!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:09.75,0:10:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:16.63,0:10:19.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And then these tentacles were like {\i1}boom{\i0}!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.47,0:10:24.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true! It wasn't a costume either!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.77,0:10:25.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it interesting?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:25.97,0:10:28.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An alien, some country's secret project, an engineered person!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.98,0:10:31.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, an undiscovered...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:31.56,0:10:35.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But he's a pretty good-looking guy,\N don't you think?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:35.15,0:10:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For you to have a crush on him.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to what I'm saying!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.70,0:10:43.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get weird ideas, sister.\N He's a monster!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:43.28,0:10:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know. He's a monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:46.66,0:10:50.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're even more\N of a monster, though.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:52.13,0:10:54.75,Thought,,0,0,0,,But... this girl...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:55.13,0:10:56.46,Thought,,0,0,0,,Where have I seen her?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:00.26,0:11:02.47,Thought,,0,0,0,,The first year student, Natsumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.93,Thought,,0,0,0,,Natsumi Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:09.14,0:11:12.69,Thought,,0,0,0,,I've found something interesting for the first time in a while.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:13.98,0:11:15.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm taking these photos.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:26.62,0:11:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mother, I'm going to Yumi's place.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:30.46,0:11:32.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 99,0:11:33.79,0:11:36.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay. Bye, Mother.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:08.24,0:12:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That sure is smooth, Natsumi.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:16.08,0:12:18.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So the top student, Natsumi Rumi,
Dialogue: 99,0:12:19.09,0:12:21.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,transforms into a woman\N of the night, huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you want with me?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:24.38,0:12:25.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:25.64,0:12:30.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just want to get a {\i1}little{\i0} better acquainted with him.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:31.73,0:12:32.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's simple.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:32.73,0:12:36.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring him to the Shaggai Bar\N by the station tomorrow at 4.
Dialogue: 99,0:12:36.23,0:12:40.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)}Spend the night thinking about what will happen if you refuse.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:08.39,0:13:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.43,0:13:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A thank you for everything until now.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:10.97,0:13:12.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A thank you?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:18.69,0:13:19.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:19.94,0:13:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:22.28,0:13:23.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:39.21,0:13:41.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, it's me.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.67,0:13:43.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you get the gang together?
Dialogue: 99,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:55.06,0:13:56.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's something...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to ask for a while, but...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:58.81,0:13:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first time we met at the cafe...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:03.28,0:14:04.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Back then...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you run away?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:07.99,0:14:13.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Th-That was because I was interested in you back then, Ryou.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:13.83,0:14:14.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:54.16,0:14:55.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Great job!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:37.49,0:15:40.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Milady, you have a telephone call.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:43.38,0:15:44.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Maki, this is bad!
Dialogue: 99,0:15:45.67,0:15:48.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your sister and the others are with the monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what might\N happen. They're at...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:00.39,0:16:03.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This building has been\N abandoned for two years.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:03.52,0:16:07.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we use it from time to time.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's good for things like this.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.62,0:16:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou! Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:28.80,0:16:31.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The night is long.\N Let's enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:32.22,0:16:33.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice and slowly!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:38.93,0:16:39.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:16:43.56,0:16:47.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,From what my friends say,\N you turn into a real monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:49.86,0:16:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:51.57,0:16:52.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's see the monster!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:00.45,0:17:03.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I know how to defend myself!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:03.83,0:17:05.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come and get it!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:07.67,0:17:11.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Milady, you cannot take\N something like that!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait! Milady!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:32.32,0:17:35.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, who's next?!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like strong girls.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.16,0:18:26.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:59.82,0:19:01.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:19.55,0:19:20.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is cool!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:22.80,0:19:25.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, you bastard!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:50.16,0:19:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'll return to normal soon.\N He'll return... He'll return soon.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.81,0:21:38.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do something!\N H-He's your boyfriend, right?!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.91,0:21:51.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You pervert! You weakling!
Dialogue: 99,0:21:52.24,0:21:53.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:54.95,0:21:56.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sugiura Ryou...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:56.50,0:21:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:54.47,0:22:55.97,Thought,,0,0,0,,I remember!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:55.97,0:23:01.02,Thought,,0,0,0,,I lost my memory after\N I absorbed this life form.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:02.52,0:23:04.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What? What's going on?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:04.94,0:23:06.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:06.03,0:23:07.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I am...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.03,0:23:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a collector!{not a Collectr}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:17.16,0:23:19.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All life forms, from all the worlds...{false trailing i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:19.58,0:23:19.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.05,0:23:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rumi!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:28.21,0:23:29.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,R-Ryou!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:40.64,0:23:43.77,Thought,,0,0,0,,Why? Why is a part of my collection...{false trailing i-frame}
Dialogue: 99,0:23:43.77,0:23:45.19,Thought,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.19,0:23:47.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:47.57,0:23:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:48.78,0:23:50.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:52.66,0:23:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave!
Dialogue: 99,0:24:37.91,0:24:40.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Sugiura from Mitaka.
Dialogue: 99,0:24:40.62,0:24:41.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 99,0:24:41.83,0:24:44.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When I masturbate,\N I see lights and hear birds,
Dialogue: 99,0:24:44.67,0:24:48.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and when I wake up,\N my room is all trashed.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:41.72,0:25:44.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Telephone\N Communication Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:44.85,0:25:47.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, this is Telephone\NCommunication Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:47.48,0:25:50.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Yumi, and you are?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:50.98,0:25:51.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:54.65,0:25:57.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Telecom Madonna.
Dialogue: 99,0:25:57.11,0:25:58.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that good enough?
Dialogue: 99,0:25:59.70,0:26:01.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what do you want?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:01.70,0:26:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you wearing right now?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:05.04,0:26:06.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What color is your underwear?
Dialogue: 99,0:26:20.34,0:26:23.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard my sister was working here, so...
Dialogue: 99,0:26:24.22,0:26:27.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's only her second day, but I hear she's picking it up.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:27.52,0:26:29.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's really impressed.
Dialogue: 99,0:26:44.29,0:26:47.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:01.05,0:27:01.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm done!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:01.84,0:27:03.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 99,0:27:24.95,0:27:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Per-ver-t.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.38,0:27:37.38,Sign,,0,0,0,,
